  "goodToKnow": "Die Popularität is popularity: an Popularität gewinnen, verlieren, die Popularitätswerte (approval ratings). German pollsters regularly publish rankings of politicians' popularity; the Politbarometer on ZDF is well known. The native synonym is die Beliebtheit: beliebt means popular, and populär is a bit more formal. Don't confuse it with populistisch (populist). It has no plural."
